---
// Illustrative: MapStore queries before and after the redesign (average query time down 40%).
---

<div class="demo demo-map" data-seq data-cycle="11000" role="img" aria-label="Illustration: a paginated MapStore query returns map regions, and average query time drops by 40 percent.">
  <div class="map">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 300 200" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="hex" width="24" height="41.57" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="scale(0.9)">
          <path d="M12 0 L24 6.93 L24 20.78 L12 27.71 L0 20.78 L0 6.93 Z M12 27.71 L12 41.57" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.8" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="300" height="200" fill="url(#hex)" />
      <path class="road" d="M-10 150 C 60 120, 110 160, 170 110 S 260 60, 320 70" />
      <path class="road thin" d="M40 -10 C 70 60, 60 120, 110 210" />
      <g class="pins">
        <circle data-step data-at="900" cx="78" cy="132" r="5" />
        <circle data-step data-at="1300" cx="150" cy="118" r="5" />
        <circle data-step data-at="1700" cx="214" cy="84" r="5" />
        <circle data-step data-at="2100" cx="250" cy="140" r="5" />
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="query" data-step data-at="300">
      <span class="verb">GET</span> /mapstore/regions?bbox=…&amp;<b>page=1&amp;limit=50</b>
    </div>
    <div class="row" data-step data-at="3000">
      <span class="lbl">before</span><span class="bar"><i style="--w:100%"></i></span><span class="v">1.0×</span>
    </div>
    <div class="row" data-step data-at="4600">
      <span class="lbl">after</span><span class="bar after"><i style="--w:60%"></i></span><span class="v">0.6×</span>
    </div>
    <div class="notes" data-step data-at="6000">
      <span>paginated results</span><span>faster SQL</span><span>lighter payloads</span>
    </div>
    <div class="delta" data-step data-at="7200">40% lower average query time</div>
  </div>
  <span class="illustration-tag">illustration</span>
</div>

<style>
  .demo-map {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 4cqw;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 7cqh 5cqw;
    font-size: clamp(9px, 2.05cqw, 19px);
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .map {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 1em;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 14%, transparent);
  }

  .map svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .road {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--highlight);
    stroke-width: 7;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .road.thin {
    stroke-width: 4;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .pins circle {
    fill: var(--accent);
    stroke: var(--surface);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9em;
  }

  .query {
    padding: 0.6em 0.8em;
    border-radius: 0.6em;
    background: #16181d;
    color: #d7dae0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .query .verb {
    color: #8fd18f;
    margin-right: 0.4em;
  }

  .query b {
    color: #ffd27a;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.6em 1fr 2.6em;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6em;
  }

  .lbl,
  .v {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .bar {
    height: 1.3em;
    border-radius: 0.3em;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 6%, transparent);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .bar i {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: 0;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 28%, transparent);
    transition: width 1.1s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .bar.after i {
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .row.is-on .bar i {
    width: var(--w);
  }

  .notes {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4em;
  }

  .notes span {
    padding: 0.2em 0.7em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }

  .delta {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 0.35em 0.9em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
</style>
